out: Usage: djinterp completion [OPTION]... SHELL
out: Print a completion script for a shell.
out: 
out: Arguments:
out:   SHELL               bash, zsh, fish or powershell
out: 
out: Options:
out:   -h, --help          display this help and exit
out: 
out: Global options:
out:   -q, --quiet         say nothing but errors
out:   -v, --verbose       say more; twice, more again
out:       --color[=WHEN]  colour diagnostics: auto (the default), always or never
