out: Commands:
out:   list                list the djins, a line each
out:   describe            describe a djin: its commands and settings
out:   get                 print settings as statements that load back; every one,
out:                       without a NAME
out:   set                 write settings to the user's settings file
out:   help                display help for a command
out:   completion          print a completion script for a shell
